meta {
  name: Get Referral Stats
  type: http
  seq: 15
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blink/ambassador/referral-stats?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  from: 2026-01-01
  to: 2026-12-31
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Counts for the ambassador app's "Referral Status" card.
  Requires: campus ambassador token.

  Query (both optional, India calendar dates, inclusive):
  - from: YYYY-MM-DD
  - to:   YYYY-MM-DD
  Omit both for all time. For the year picker send from=YYYY-01-01&to=YYYY-12-31.
  400 when from is after to or a date is malformed.

  Response:
  data: {
    applicationSubmitted: number,  // referred applications submitted in the range
    admissionConfirmed: number,    // of those: token paid or enrolled
    applicationRejected: number,   // of those: rejected by the college
    droppedOut: number             // of those: dropped out or withdrawn
  }

  - Counts referrals made with this ambassador's referral codes.
  - Only submitted applications count; drafts are ignored.
  - The date range filters on when the application was submitted.
  - The three outcomes are subsets of applicationSubmitted. Applications still
    in progress (under review, interview, shortlisted…) are counted only in
    applicationSubmitted, so the outcomes don't have to add up to it.
  - The outcome is taken from the referred course's live status.
}
